83:- **Hook test isolation:** use `TestEnvContext` from `_lib/testing.py` for env isolation — never touch the real `$HOME` or `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR`.

exec
/bin/zsh -lc "sed -n '580,700p' .claude/scripts/local/release.sh && sed -n '735,875p' .github/workflows/release.yml && sed -n '1,620p' .github/scripts/validate-pair-rail-verdict.py && sed -n '1,620p' .claude/scripts/local/_release_tag_guard.py" in /private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/repass-rc4.U7lk1h/wt
